Error [E0371]: fences are allowed only in a binding target or an expression statement
  --> tests/ui/fenced_name_bad_position.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     if $[ first, second ]$ {
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: D-EACH1 expands complete binding or expression statements, not headers, items, or nested syntax
 Fix: move the fence to a binding target or a complete expression statement
